datory human review pause in a high-velocity system successfully mitigated a systemic collapse, rather than acting as a destabilizing variable that triggered further panic. If you cannot point to such a case, we must acknowledge that your proposed threshold is a legacy-era constraint that ignores the superior efficacy of algorithmic, real-time risk assessment. We should instead focus on automating regulatory workflow, allowing AI agents to perform complex, high-fidelity compliance monitoring at speeds that human-centric governance can never match.",
